<Layout title="Terms — Good Apollo Goods" description="Terms for using and shopping the Good Apollo Goods website.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Terms" title="Website & shop terms." intro="These terms cover use of the Good Apollo Goods website and will be expanded with final checkout terms before online purchasing opens." />
  <section class="container policy"><p class="policy-date">Last updated September 2026</p><h2>Product information</h2><p>Each piece is handmade in a small batch. Minor variations in color, texture, and construction are part of handmade production. Product pages provide the most current materials, sizing, and availability state.</p><h2>Pricing and availability</h2><p>Coming-soon previews are not offers for sale and do not display prices. Released items show their actual price and availability. An available item added to a cart is not reserved until checkout is complete.</p><h2>Care and fit</h2><p>Customers are responsible for reviewing the size guide and care instructions before ordering. Please contact the studio with questions before purchase.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@goodapollogoods.com">hello@goodapollogoods.com</a> with questions about these terms.</p></section>
</Layout>
